_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 31
---
order: 31
---
short_label: III.31
---
statement: In a circle the angle in the semicircle is right, that in a greater segment less than a right angle, and that in a less segment greater than a right angle; further the angle of the greater segment is greater than a right angle, and the angle of the less segment is less than a right angle.
---
proof:

